# the argument of orchard.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
atom	graft_sick_stock(x)	x: grafted from a sick stock sickens in its third summer
atom	tree(x)	x: tree
atom	graft_old_pear(x)	x: was grafted from the old pear by the wall
atom	sicken_fourth_summer(x)	x: will sicken before the fourth summer comes
P1	S1	(all x: tree(x) -> graft_sick_stock(x))
P2	S2	graft_old_pear(north_row)
C	S3	sicken_fourth_summer(north_row)
